---
const title = 'Ready to build\nwithout borders?';
---

<section id="contact" class="bg-white py-20 max-[900px]:py-15" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
	<div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-275 grid-cols-[1.6fr_1fr] items-stretch gap-7.5 px-5 max-[900px]:grid-cols-1 max-[900px]:gap-8">
		<div
			class="c5-animated-gradient flex min-h-90 flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-3xl px-10 py-20 text-center text-white max-[640px]:px-6"
			style="box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)"
		>
			<p class="mb-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/75">Construyendo futuro</p>
			<h2 id="cta-title" class="mb-3.75 whitespace-pre-line text-5xl font-normal leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.03em] max-[640px]:text-4xl">
				{title}
			</h2>
			<p class="mb-7.5 text-[0.95rem] font-normal text-white/85">Software con propósito, diseñado para avanzar contigo.</p>
			<a
				href="mailto:hello@alwayzz.studio?subject=Hablemos%20de%20mi%20proyecto"
				class="rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 px-8 py-3.5 text-[0.95rem] font-semibold text-white no-underline shadow-[0_10px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_14px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-neutral-900"
			>
				Hablemos de tu proyecto
			</a>
		</div>

		<div class="flex min-h-90 flex-col justify-center rounded-3xl border border-[#f0f0f0] bg-[#fafafa] p-10 max-[640px]:min-h-0 max-[640px]:p-7">
			<p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#888]">Una buena conversación</p>
			<h3 class="max-w-70 text-3xl font-normal leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.04em] text-neutral-900">Tu siguiente idea merece una forma clara.</h3>
			<p class="mt-5 max-w-75 text-[0.9rem] leading-[1.6] text-[#666]">Cuéntanos qué quieres construir y encontraremos el camino más simple para hacerlo realidad.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
